{
  "bookId": "hero-214013",
  "id": "bond-26058",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "26058001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "我坐在这里，应该能方便拉斐尔画画吧？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "嗯。不过……凑这么近，真的没关系吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "什么没关系？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "……我是说，主人一直保持这个姿势，不会累吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "没关系，等待礼物的过程，很开心哦。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "我会努力画好的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "嗯，我相信拉斐尔的画技。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不过在拉斐尔你继续前，我觉得有件事需要先提醒你一下。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "主人？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "拉斐尔，你的脸红了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "我的脸……？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "不要慌张，我的意思是，你的脸上沾上了红色的颜料。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "主人……真过分。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那作为道歉，需要我帮你擦掉吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "26058015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "拉斐尔",
          "text": "不……嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
